# oilfield.skin — after the UVL oil game: many small panels, each its own
# colour identity, on a dark dithered field. Canon combos: grey card with
# blue ink (0x71), brown cargo panel (0x60), green-on-black dialog (0x02),
# yellow guidance, red money.
